3 tier Architecture
################################
* Web Server
    ==> It is the front-end of an App
    ==> Also known as Presentation layer
    ==> UI/UX developers works for this
    ==> html, css, javascript are commonly used

* App Server
    ==> The purpose of using app server is to use the application
    ==> Also known as Logic layer
    ==> Source code will be stored in this layer
    ==> Back-end developers works for this
    ==> Java, Python, C++ are commonly used

* DB Server
    ==> The purpose of using DB server is to store and retrieve the data from DB
    ==> Also known as DB layer
    ==> DB Admins works for this
    ==> SQL, Oracle, Postgress SQL are commonly used

